+\[
+ R_P(\delta,\delta_Q)=32\eta(\delta)+64\delta_Q
+   +\frac{12md+4d+14}{q},
+ \qquad
+ G_P(\delta,\delta_Q)=\min\{1,R_P(\delta,\delta_Q)\}.
+\]
+All powers are real powers.
+\end{definition}
